  - DisplayName: Young Serpent
    PlanIndex: 0
    FillToEvolve: 0.9
    BankToEvolve: {x: 0, y: 3337.7, z: 0, w: 0}
    MealVolume: 1912.1
    Palette:
      MembraneBright: {r: 0.2, g: 0.85, b: 0.8, a: 1}
      MembraneDull: {r: 0, g: 0.45, b: 0.42, a: 1}
      NucleusEdge: {r: 0, g: 0.55, b: 0.5, a: 0.41}
      NucleusStraight: {r: 0.25, g: 0.7, b: 0.65, a: 0.41}
      Cytoplasm: {r: 0.3, g: 0.5, b: 0.48, a: 1}
    Line: The brood knots into a young serpent. It is hungry.
  - DisplayName: Serpent
    PlanIndex: 1
    FillToEvolve: 0.9
    BankToEvolve: {x: 0, y: 5224.2, z: 0, w: 0}
    MealVolume: 2191
    Palette:
      MembraneBright: {r: 0.15, g: 0.9, b: 0.45, a: 1}
      MembraneDull: {r: 0, g: 0.5, b: 0.2, a: 1}
      NucleusEdge: {r: 0, g: 0.6, b: 0.25, a: 0.43}
      NucleusStraight: {r: 0.2, g: 0.72, b: 0.35, a: 0.43}
      Cytoplasm: {r: 0.28, g: 0.5, b: 0.34, a: 1}
    Line: The serpent grows longer. Burn what it means to eat.
  - DisplayName: Great Serpent
    PlanIndex: 2
    FillToEvolve: 0.9
    BankToEvolve: {x: 0, y: 7594.4, z: 0, w: 0}
    MealVolume: 2743
    Palette:
      MembraneBright: {r: 0.35, g: 1.1, b: 0.6, a: 1}
      MembraneDull: {r: 0, g: 0.38, b: 0.18, a: 1}
      NucleusEdge: {r: 0.05, g: 0.5, b: 0.25, a: 0.45}
      NucleusStraight: {r: 0.3, g: 0.8, b: 0.45, a: 0.45}
      Cytoplasm: {r: 0.25, g: 0.45, b: 0.3, a: 1}
    Line: A great serpent now. One more meal and it will change.
  - DisplayName: Bull
    PlanIndex: 3
    FillToEvolve: 0.9
    BankToEvolve: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
    MealVolume: 1
    Palette:
      MembraneBright: {r: 1.3, g: 0.45, b: 0.1, a: 1}
      MembraneDull: {r: 0.6, g: 0.12, b: 0, a: 1}
      NucleusEdge: {r: 0.75, g: 0.2, b: 0, a: 0.45}
      NucleusStraight: {r: 0.9, g: 0.45, b: 0.15, a: 0.45}
      Cytoplasm: {r: 0.55, g: 0.32, b: 0.22, a: 1}
    Line: The coils fold. A bull stands where the serpent was. Break it.
  TransitionSeconds: 3
  TransitionFlash: 1.5
  EscapedPalette:
    MembraneBright: {r: 1.2, g: 0.08, b: 0.15, a: 1}
    MembraneDull: {r: 0.55, g: 0, b: 0.05, a: 1}
    NucleusEdge: {r: 0.7, g: 0, b: 0.05, a: 0.5}
    NucleusStraight: {r: 0.85, g: 0.2, b: 0.25, a: 0.5}
    Cytoplasm: {r: 0.5, g: 0.18, b: 0.2, a: 1}
  RestoreSeconds: 5
  StartLine: Something in the reef remembers the old shapes.
  HeadingForExitLine: Its last meal is behind it. Stop it before the membrane.
  EscapedLine: The cycle ends. Too soon.
  WonLine: The dance is broken. The reef keeps its turn.
  NudgeThreshold: 25
  NudgeFraction: 0.2
  MaxNudge: 6
